                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " \n\nFirst, what is a forest habitat? A forest habitat is a place where trees and other plants grow. \n\nSecond, what happens when a forest habitat is destroyed? When a forest habitat is destroyed, the trees and other plants are removed. \n\nThird, what does removing trees and other plants do to the atmosphere? Removing trees and other plants decreases the amount of oxygen in the atmosphere. \n\nTherefore, the answer is C) O_{2}.",
