                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nThe best tool to help the workers lower the piano from the window would be a pulley. Here's why:\n\n- A wheel and axle is a simple machine that consists of a wheel attached to a shaft (the axle). It is used to transmit force and motion between two points. While a wheel and axle could be used to move the piano, it would not be the best tool for lowering it from a window. This is because a wheel and axle would require the workers to manually turn the wheel to lower the piano, which would be difficult and potentially dangerous.\n- An inclined plane is a flat surface that is sloped, allowing objects to be moved up or down with less force than if they were lifted straight up. While an inclined plane could be used to lower the piano, it would require a long ramp that would take up a lot of space and be difficult to set up in a building.\n- A wedge is a simple machine that is used to split or lift objects. While a wedge could be used to lift the piano, it would not be the best tool for lowering it from a window. This is because a wedge would require the workers to lift the piano and place the wedge underneath it, which would be difficult and potentially dangerous.\n- A pulley is a simple machine that consists of a wheel with a groove in its rim and a rope or cable that runs through the groove. It is used to change the direction of a force and make it easier to lift heavy objects. A pulley would be the best tool for lowering the piano from the window because it would allow the workers to use a rope or cable to lower the piano safely and with less effort. By attaching the rope or cable to the piano and running it through the pulley, the workers could use their weight to control the speed of the descent and ensure that the piano is lowered safely to the ground.",
