                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nPlants use photosynthesis to survive. Photosynthesis requires light energy, chlorophyll, and water.\nChlorophyll and water are found in the plant, so we can eliminate (A) and (B).\nPlants take in carbon dioxide from the air, so we can eliminate (C).\nPlants take in water and carbon dioxide from the soil, so we can eliminate (D).\nThe correct answer is (B) nitrogen.",
