                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " If we decrease the heat energy, the particles will have less kinetic energy. If the particles have less kinetic energy, then they will be moving more slowly. If the particles are moving more slowly, then they will be less likely to escape from the liquid state (evaporation) and more likely to enter the liquid state (condensation).",
