                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: What is the new technology being developed for?\nThe new technology is being developed to help predict the weather.\n\nStep 2: How will this technology benefit people?\nThe most likely benefit of this technology is that it will help warn people about dangerous storms. \n\nStep 3: Eliminate answer choices that are not supported by the information in Step 1 and Step 2.\nA) It will show people that storms can be prevented. - This answer choice is not supported by the information given. The technology is being developed to predict the weather, not prevent storms.\nB) It will show people that science is interesting. - This answer choice is not supported by the information given. While the development of new technology can be interesting, the main purpose of this technology is to predict the weather.\nC) It will help warn people about dangerous storms. - This answer choice is supported by the information given in Step 2.\nD) It will help people drive in the rain. - This answer choice is not supported by the information given. While the technology may provide more accurate weather predictions, it is not specifically designed to help people drive in the rain.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C) It will help warn people about dangerous storms.",
